LZMA SDK 26.06 (github.com/ip7z/7zip/releases/download/26.06/lzma2606.7z, linked from 7-zip.org/sdk.html, sha256 1d9da340870b12712e9068be178a4436fbad785486b62aed6e2aa88ea1e3bb65), public domain (DOC/lzma-sdk.txt: "LZMA SDK is written and placed in the public domain by Igor Pavlov"). C/LzmaDec.c, C/LzmaDec.h and the headers they include (C/7zTypes.h, C/Compiler.h, C/Precomp.h), unmodified. Used by aacert.c to unpack the stock Android Auto module from flash.
